      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- Better feedback for locked door.\n- IAP handling improvements.\n- Fixed quests not counting in solo games in Slaughterhouse.\n- Black Hole: reduced duration by <color=red>−75%</color> (max 30 s, was 120 s)\n- Ethereal Resurgence: reduced duration by <color=red>−50%</color> (max 30 s, was 60 s)\n- Hope, Wake Up, Will Make It, Lifesaver buff: <color=green>+50%</color> item reveal range at low levels\n- Leader, Victim Power buff: <color=green>+40%</color> item reveal range at low levels\n- Soul Guard buff: 3x longer at level 1 (15 s, was 5 s)\n- Wildcard now refreshes everyone's perks with cooldowns, including One Rises and Self Care\n- Fixed Speed Boots perk losing its bonus after Adrenaline Shot, Stealth Potion, Pursuit Surge or Recovery Gift ended, or after the player was revived.\n\n- Other changes and improvements"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c1638107f0d31643a667df968f6d690, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: c2d60f7cc52a8e34d8c44457f10911cd, type: 2}
